# Peragus, the escape (TSL, 103PER, 106PER to the Ebon Hawk): T3-M4 found
# in the fuel pipe and rejoining, the concealed stash's Hangar 25 control
# conduit, the emergency field shut down, the hangar's console (the
# conduit replaced, the door open), the decontamination console, the
# hangar's turret (the troopers let aboard) and the boarders fought on the
# Ebon Hawk, the asteroid field (keep our distance, someone may be alive:
# LSP), the escape, Kreia and Atton, and the galaxy map to Telos. Starts
# from the Harbinger's checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @peragus_escape data/routes/tsl/peragus_escape.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Escape from Peragus" (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
to WP_T3_DEAD          # T3 in the fuel pipe: he talks as the party comes up
say Don't blame yourself # (+INF), and rejoins
talk
use OddCase          # the concealed stash: the Hangar 25 control conduit
to G_T_SONIC02_EMER1 # the three charges in the fuel lines set off (the
fight 30             # station's own words: disarm or detonate them): the
gone G_T_SONIC02_EMER2 # mine by the stash walked into, the small doorway's
gone G_T_SONIC02_EMER3 # and the one inside the door by the ramp sprung in
                     # the fight with the droids (as DSimpson warns)
say Shut down emergency field # the emergency field station: the exit
say =Log out.        # ramp's field down
use EmerStation
talk
fight 30             # the four droids where T3 was ambushed
exit To_106PER       # up the ramp and right: into the hangar bay
fight 30             # droids all the way back to the hangar controls
leader 8             # T3 at the hangar console (DSimpson): the emergency
say emergency control commands # controls, [Repair] the diagnostic,
say run diagnostic   # [Computer] the sub-systems, the door to Hangar 25
say check status of emergency # tried, the conduit replaced: the door
say Open blast door to Hangar 25 # opens
say Replace hangar control power conduit
use HangarTer
talk
leader player
fight 30             # droids down the curved halls and the mined ramps
leader 8             # T3 at the decontamination console ([Computer]):
say Slice the system # the console sliced, the decontamination shut down,
say Access remote camera controls # the chamber opened
say Decontamination Chamber
say Attempt to shut down the decontamination system
say Return to main console functions
say Open decontamination chamber
use DecCon
talk
leader player
save peragus_hangar25
leader 8             # past the chamber, T3 picks the low security door
unlock PeragusDoor1@8 # (DC 25) into the room before the hangar
leader player
# Through the formerly poisonous room to Hangar 25 and the Ebon Hawk:
# Atton wants the laser turret (DSimpson lets the troopers board and
# fights them inside).
exit TO_107PERm      # up the ramp: aboard
module 107per        # Atton's 106percut: the turret (permov04), troopers sent every 2 s
turrets              # until all 25 troopers are dead or aboard; Atton's turend answered
module 005ebo        # the boarded Ebon Hawk
fight 60             # the boarders (DSimpson: let them board, fight them inside)
module 003ebo        # after the last falls: Kreia (turend's end) and the escape
talk                 # met by turend's end
# The asteroids (DSimpson: keep our distance, and "no, someone might be
# alive", LSP):
say Just do your best to keep your distance
say No - someone might still be alive
talk                 # 003atton: the asteroids blown (a_next_scene: the next scene)
talk                 # 003atton again: all of them on what happened; Kreia to the crew quarters
save peragus_escaped
# Kreia, sent to the port room (DSimpson's light side answer about Atton
# at her end), then back to Atton (his LSP), then the galaxy map, open once
# Kreia has been heard:
say The fool has a name
use kreia            # in the crew quarters: 003kreia
talk
say ease off the insults
use Atton
talk
use Galaxymap
travel 10            # Telos: Citadel Station (planetary.2da; the map offers it, not 9)
module 201tel        # the Ebon Hawk docks at Citadel Station
save telos_arrival
